{
  "info": {
    "name": "ATLAS - msautenticacion v2",
    "description": "Coleccion completa para probar el microservicio de autenticacion y autorizacion del sistema ATLAS.\n\nRoles del sistema:\n- ADMIN (rolId: 1) - Acceso total\n- CONSULTOR (rolId: 2) - Evaluaciones a normas\n- GESTOR_NORMAS (rolId: 3) - Gestion de normas\n\nFlujo basico:\n1. Ejecutar Login para obtener el token JWT\n2. El token se guarda automaticamente en {{token}}\n3. Probar los demas endpoints\n\nCredenciales:\n- Usuario: admin / Contrasena: admin123",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8081/ms-autenticacion",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "usuarioId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "politicaId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Auth - Login / Logout",
      "description": "Endpoints de autenticacion. Login genera JWT, Logout lo invalida.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login - admin/admin123",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"nombreUsuario\": \"admin\",\n    \"contrasenia\": \"admin123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login - Credenciales invalidas (401)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"nombreUsuario\": \"admin\",\n    \"contrasenia\": \"wrongpassword\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login - Validacion campos vacios (400)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"nombreUsuario\": \"\",\n    \"contrasenia\": \"\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout - Invalida el token actual",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "logout"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
